{"parse": {"title": "交接日-08", "pageid": 123643, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-07\" title=\"交接日-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">交接日-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">交接日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A0.E5.AE.9A.E4.B9.89.E2.80.9C.E6.AD.A3.E7.A1.AE.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"无定义“正确”\">无定义“正确”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 无定义“正确”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Undefined Good</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">17:00 第一防线学校·校外</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 16.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">第一防线学校·校外</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达原本因装满成就感而雀跃的心情，在踏出校门时和逐渐黯淡的天色一起沉了下去。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“唉……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>贝丽尔：</b></span>“看起来我的女儿这一天过得并不顺利。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“妈妈？我不是说不用来接我……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>在母亲平静的注视下，玛蒂尔达的声音逐渐低了下去。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“嗯……搞不好，我的升职要泡汤了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“……但我不后悔。再来一次，我也会做一样的选择。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 17.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">校长办公室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“我想你有事需要向我解释，哈珀女士。”<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"在STAGE-07中走向“至少不要把他们关在教室里了吧？”\">在STAGE-07中走向“至少不要把他们关在教室里了吧？”</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"在STAGE-07中走向“他们应该参加校外活动”\">在STAGE-07中走向“他们应该参加校外活动”</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"在STAGE-07中走向“他们应该参加校外活动”\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“为什么我在中午见到本来应该留校的学生，被‘剃刀’小队送来了校外活动的地点？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“我不记得我有改变主意。”<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"在STAGE-07中走向“至少不要把他们关在教室里了吧？”\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“为什么我听说在我不在的期间，那些留校的学生居然跑到了体育场上，踢了一整天的——足球？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“我不记得我们有这门课程。”<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>厚重的胡桃木制办公桌后，男子的语气听不出喜怒，跟随在纪律主任身后进入办公室的拉文德的身子却忍不住抖了抖。<br />\n纪律主任低垂下眉眼，恐怕从没有任何一个学生见过她这副模样。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“非常抱歉，校长……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“这些都是……我监管不力。我不会找任何借口。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“你？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>办公桌后的人似乎开始了短暂的思索，室内被一段令人坐立不安的沉默笼罩。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“可我怎么听说，这件事是那位纪律协助教员，玛蒂尔达·布翁尼小姐张罗的？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“如您所说，她只是一个纪律协助教员——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>纪律主任的话被轻柔又不容置疑地折断了。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“但她和年轻时候的你一样，总会有些新鲜的点子。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“后面的那个小姑娘，你叫拉文德对吗？我听哈珀女士说过你的事了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“你对玛蒂尔达·布翁尼小姐的看法如何？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“我……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“不必有所顾虑，拉文德小姐。我已经听说了布翁尼小姐荣升三级调查员的事，打从心底为她高兴。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“无论今天你给出什么样的答案，我保证不会有人受到影响。毕竟委员会的决定，说到底也不是我们能够左右的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>校长：</b></span>“我只是想要知道你的真实看法。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“好的，校长先生。稍等，我把今天一整天的事都记录了下来……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>其实她并不知道自己应该如何回答。她无意包庇，却也心存疑虑。<br />\n怎样的回答是正确的——怎样才是正确的？<br />\n拉文德的头脑一片空白，直到她胡乱翻开自己的笔记本。<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">向左滑动打开笔记本</small>\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda gamepic 04.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png/80px-Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"84\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png/120px-Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png/160px-Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"352\" data-file-height=\"371\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda gamepic 03.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png/80px-Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png/120px-Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png/160px-Rolestory_madierda_gamepic_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"348\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 08.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a></div>\n<p>——最重要的是成为自己，成为理想中的自己。<br />\n说出这句话的那人的身影倒映在拉文德的眼前。<br />\n她会如何回答？而她又想要如何作答？<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“我认为……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她深吸了一口气。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“我认为，玛蒂尔达小姐是一位令人印象深刻的纪律协助教员。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“而在遥远的未来……也许，她会是一位了不起的‘玛蒂尔达小姐’。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 16.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">第一防线学校·校外</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>哔哔，哔哔。<br />\n清脆的提示音让垂头丧气的玛蒂尔达当场跳了起来，她战战兢兢地掏出了那台便携联络装置。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>系统通知：</b></span>“玛蒂尔达·布翁尼小姐，您的身份权限已更新为：三级调查员。圣洛夫基金会期待您未来继续在工作中发挥能力——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>后面的话玛蒂尔达已经看不进去了。她捧着手里的联络装置，心情像是坐上了过山车，被猛地从谷底一口气拔到云霄。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“妈妈，妈妈！你看——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达扑向身旁的母亲，她们的这一天以一顿丰盛的庆贺晚餐画上了句号。<br />\n——次日，玛蒂尔达·布翁尼前往圣洛夫基金会报到，领取了她作为三级调查员的第一个任务。<br />\n</p></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "交接日-08"}}